cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "wickra-impact"
abstract: >-
  A backtester that prices its own market impact, built on the Wickra core:
  instead of filling an order at the close or at a fixed slippage estimate, it
  walks the order through the recorded L2 order book level by level, or prices
  it from an analytic impact curve, so the reported slippage is measured rather
  than assumed. Exposed as a JSON-over-C-ABI data API in ten languages.
type: software
